# Secrets — hard rules

- Never hardcode or commit API keys/tokens. Read them only from env vars or Cursor secrets.
- Never print a secret's value — not in logs, test output, or chat.
- Keys belong in env vars (`ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`, `FREELLMAPI_KEY`) or `--api-key`, never in files.
- This repo is PUBLIC, so Cursor secret injection is disabled by default. Run live
  Claude locally with your own key, or make the repo private before relying on
  injected secrets in cloud agents.
